 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Great hobby. There are so many to choose from. Do you have a favorite genre, or is it something new altogether? Then The Cooking Podcast is probably for you. There's Sous Vide Made Simple, The Tender Shoot, and The Slice that all focus on food. For history, There's A History of Everything. Not for podcasts themselves, but for listening to them on your busy commute. Many people use podcast apps like Overcast or Podcast Player. Then try one of the shorter ones I mentioned and see how it feels. You can always try something longer later.",
